      "GroupOrder": 46,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "663",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 4,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.800000011920929
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804052,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 47,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "大家都不会露出“好辛苦！”的表情。/n明明一定也像视频和自拍一样有很多NG，却完全不让人看到。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040420",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804053,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 48,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "感觉很独特。与其说“一起努力吧！”，/n更像是拿各自努力之后的“成果”去互相碰撞。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040430",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804054,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 49,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "670",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 4,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.800000011920929
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804055,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 50,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我自认为也在努力，可总觉得很难追上大家。/n而且我本来就是比起想来想去、偷偷准备，更喜欢一下子冲出去做的类型！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040440",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804056,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 51,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1410",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 4,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.800000011920929
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804057,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 52,
      "SpeakerName": "潘达",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈哈，和天狼星差好多。/n天狼星更像是“大家作为伙伴一起加油！”这种感觉。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040450",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 10501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "105"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804058,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 53,
      "SpeakerName": "潘达",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "当然，彼此也是竞争对手，会互相切磋，/n不过“大家牵着手一起努力吧！”的感觉更强。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040460",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "105"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804059,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 54,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "很有天狼星的风格呢。我自己会想“大家都是同一个剧团的伙伴！”，/n可银河座更像“彼此都是竞争对手！”。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040470",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
