      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 55,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊，不过拉莫姐来了之后，可能有一点变化。/n好像稍微更亲近了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040480",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2000804061,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2000804,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 56,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "但果然，剧团成员有好几百人，真正拿到有名字角色的就那么一点吧？/n经常会争同一个角色，没拿到的话也会不甘心。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20008040490",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
